  "description": "The INVENIO GRIFN A brings together the best of both worlds in a unique allroad aluminium bike that impresses in both performance and design. Built on the same acclaimed geometry as the carbon Grifn, this bike offers a perfect balance of speed, comfort, and control, making it ideal for both asphalt and gravel. The bike is designed with maximum versatility in mind: you can effortlessly switch between a sporty road setup and an adventurous offroad configuration. With tire clearance up to 38 mm — or even 40 mm in a 1x drivetrain setup — and the possibility to integrate mudguards and a dynamo, the INVENIO GRIFN A is equally suited for long rides, gravel adventures, and daily commuting. Technically, this bike stays true to modern standards, featuring a UDH (Universal Derailleur Hanger), which is rare in the aluminium segment and ensures future-proof compatibility and ease of use. What truly sets this version apart is the exclusive Tomorrowland design. Inspired by the iconic Noah and Noah Fast Tomorrowland Edition, this bike radiates pure magic. The specially developed holographic-prismatic paint subtly shifts color depending on the light — from deep purple to warm blue to vibrant pink. On top of that, a refined prismatic layer adds a sparkling effect reminiscent of oil-slick rainbows in sunlight. The result is a bike that feels alive, constantly evolving and revealing new dimensions. The INVENIO GRIFN A embodies the shared vision of two Belgian pioneers: innovation, experience, and discovery. It is a versatile all-rounder for riders who refuse to compromise — neither in performance nor in aesthetics.",
